  "mn142:0.1": "Middle Discourses 142 ",
  "mn142:0.2": "The Analysis of Religious Donations ",
  "mn142:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "mn142:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying in the land of the Sakyans, near Kapilavatthu in the Banyan Tree Monastery. ",
  "mn142:2.1": "Then Mahāpajāpati Gotamī approached the Buddha bringing a new pair of garments. She bowed, sat down to one side, and said to the Buddha, ",
  "mn142:2.2": "“Sir, I have spun and woven this new pair of garments specially for the Buddha. ",
  "mn142:2.3": "May the Buddha please accept this from me out of sympathy.” ",
  "mn142:2.4": "When she said this, the Buddha said to her, ",
  "mn142:2.5": "“Give it to the Saṅgha, Gotamī. ",
  "mn142:2.6": "When you give to the Saṅgha, both the Saṅgha and I will be honored.” ",
  "mn142:2.7": "For a second time … ",
  "mn142:2.8": "",
  "mn142:2.9": "",
  "mn142:2.10": "",
  "mn142:2.11": "",
  "mn142:2.12": "",
  "mn142:2.13": "For a third time, Mahāpajāpati Gotamī said to the Buddha, ",
  "mn142:2.14": "“Sir, I have spun and woven this new pair of garments specially for the Buddha. ",
  "mn142:2.15": "May the Buddha please accept this from me out of sympathy.” ",
  "mn142:2.16": "And for a third time, the Buddha said to her, ",
  "mn142:2.17": "“Give it to the Saṅgha, Gotamī. ",
  "mn142:2.18": "When you give to the Saṅgha, both the Saṅgha and I will be honored.” ",
  "mn142:3.1": "When he said this, Venerable Ānanda said to the Buddha, ",
